  "description": "Si-Hu’s life is a pretty good one. He’s starting a new job at a pretty decent company, he’s been happily married to a gorgeous wife for six years, and he’s pretty good-looking himself. But one day, everything starts cracking at the edges when he starts to suspect that his beautiful wife Si-A is having an affair. He can’t stop obsessing and worrying over it, but his pretty coworker Min-A might have the perfect solution: a steamy affair of his own. Si-Hu isn’t sure this is the right thing to do, but it’s hard to say no when his wife is more suspicious than ever and there so many gorgeous women at his office. So maybe a little infidelity can’t hurt…right? \n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
